  "body": "Part 2 of the #853 split. Sub-issue: #4256. Depends on #4255. Rebuilt from current `main`; 8 files. Stacked on PR #4258 (Part 1): `fonts.rs` calls `camcraft_i18n::lang()`, so this branch is not standalone until #4258 merges.\n\n- Bundles Noto Sans SC 400 subset (GB2312 + punctuation, OFL 1.1, ~2.2 MB) and its licence entry; `scripts/fonts/subset_sc.py` records how the subset was made.\n- Loads the face in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/fonts.rs`.\n- Adds `ViewPrefs.language` (BCP 47 text, absent = follow system locale; a malformed tag is a status note, not an unreadable preferences file).\n- Adds the View door's Language list, live switching persisted to `prefs.json`; `CAMCRAFT_LANG` overrides for one run.\n\n**No translated strings are routed yet.**\n\nVerification: font `cmap` coverage test and `cargo test -p camcraft-ui` to be run by CI (Rust 1.90 required). Posted output and project files are unchanged by this PR.\n\nSupersedes the font/picker slice of #3304.\n",
